flowchart TD
  Q["Tool / resource request"] --> PEP["Policy enforcement point"]
  PEP --> PIP["Trusted attributes"]
  PIP --> PDP["Versioned policy decision"]
  PDP -->|ALLOW + obligations| E["Execute + validate output"]
  PDP -->|REQUIRE_APPROVAL| H["Human effect review"]
